{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ2w4HzC8H5Kbwo6MV1t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't find this number with these tools. I didn't estimate a figure to fill the gap.\n\n**Where the figure should be:** 3D Systems' director compensation table for 2023 should be in its 2024 proxy statement (DEF 14A), filed 13 August 2024. Full-text search found that filing and the 2025 proxy, but it only returns links to filings. It can't show me what the documents say, so I couldn't read the table or add up the per-director totals.\n\n**Other routes I tried:**\n- A search for the exact phrase \"2023 Director Compensation\" in 3D Systems filings found nothing.\n- 3D Systems' structured financial data (XBRL) has nothing on director compensation. The only cover-page items it reports are shares outstanding and public float.\n\nTo get the answer, open the \"Director Compensation\" section of the August 2024 proxy at the link below and add up the \"Total\" column for 2023.\n\n**Sources**\n- DEF 14A, filed 2024-08-13, accession 0001193125-24-199863 (https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/910638/000119312524199863/d914592ddef14a.htm). Found, but I couldn't read its contents.\n- DEF 14A, filed 2025-04-04, accession 0001193125-25-073438. Also found by the search, but its table would cover 2024, not 2023."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":477,"cache_read_input_tokens":6887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":477},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d48138d4-7e34-440d-b69e-d6126d0591da","uuid":"64cddef7-f5fa-40e1-95c9-3d95cc4f66bb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:08:59.734Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ2w41spd3u3yZtH